#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.dati-raccolti"
msgstr "Data collected"

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.attraverso-il-modulo-contatti"
msgstr "Through the contact form we collect the data you enter voluntarily: full name, email address, telephone number if provided, profile (student, professional, organisation), university, company or sector if provided, and the content of your message."

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.finalita-e-base-giuridica"
msgstr "Purposes and legal basis"

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.i-dati-sono-usati"
msgstr "Your data is used exclusively to reply to your request and, if you wish, to inform you about the activities of the association. Legal basis: your consent (Art. 6.1.a GDPR) and the performance of pre-contractual measures requested by you (Art. 6.1.b)."

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.modalita"
msgstr "How it works"

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.il-modulo-contatti-non"
msgstr "The contact form does not store data on the site: when you submit it, your email program opens with a pre-filled email addressed to the controller. The message is handled by your email provider and by ours. This site does not use profiling cookies or analytics tools."

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.iscrizione-agli-eventi"
msgstr "Event registration"

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.l-iscrizione-agli-eventi"
msgstr "Registration for events is done through a Google Forms form, reached with the \"Sign up\" button. The data you enter in the form (the data the form asks for) is collected and stored by Google, which acts as a service provider on behalf of the association, and can only be viewed by the managers of Next Level. We use it exclusively to organise the event and to send you information about it. Legal basis: performance of your request to take part (Art. 6.1.b GDPR). Registration data is kept for as long as needed for the event and no longer than 24 months, unless you give further consent. By clicking \"Sign up\" you leave this site and go to Google: their privacy policy applies (<a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">policies.google.com/privacy</a>)."

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.conservazione"
msgstr "Retention"

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.i-dati-sono-conservati"
msgstr "Data is kept for the time needed to handle your request and, in any case, no longer than 24 months after the last contact, unless required by law."

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.comunicazione-dei-dati"
msgstr "Disclosure of data"

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.i-dati-non-sono"
msgstr "Data is neither sold nor disseminated. It may be accessed only by authorised persons of the association and by the technical service providers (email) needed for its management."

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.i-tuoi-diritti"
msgstr "Your rights"

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.puoi-chiedere-accesso-rettifica"
msgstr "You can request access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection and portability of your data, and withdraw your consent at any time, by writing to the controller's address. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Italian data protection authority (<a href=\"https://www.garanteprivacy.it\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">garanteprivacy.it</a>)."

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.pagina-membri"
msgstr "Members page"

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.nella-pagina-membri-pubblichiamo"
msgstr "On the Members page we publish name, company, sector, photo and LinkedIn profile link only of people who have given their consent. Any member can ask at any time for their data to be changed or removed by writing to the controller."

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.hosting"
msgstr "Hosting"

#: index.html
msgid "home.privacy.il-sito-e-ospitato"
msgstr "The site is hosted on GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc.), which may process technical browsing data (e.g. IP address) according to its own policy."

